{"id": "p002-002", "text": "Delroy - massive Spurs fan, season ticket holder, takes his son to every home game. also plays bass in a Motown covers band, they've got a gig sometime next month, first one in ages. big into fly fishing too, ties his own flies. keeps trying to get me along to a match", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Delroy", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Spurs", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "season ticket holder", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bass", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Motown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gig", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i4", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "fly fishing", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i5", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "ties his own flies", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "p002-007", "text": "gift ideas for Ioana - deep into Warhammer 40k (Ultramarines), paints her own minis. hates GW prices so vouchers wd go down well", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Warhammer 40k", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Ultramarines", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "paints her own minis", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates GW prices", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "vouchers wd go down well", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "p002-023", "text": "facetime w/ kasia + her dad. her brother Eli has his med school graduation June 14th in Kraków, whole family flying out. dad's so proud he's had a banner printed lol. Kasia then off travelling over the summer - Vietnam, Laos, maybe Cambodia. PhD starts Sept", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "med school graduation", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "graduation", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 14th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "proud", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "travelling", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "PhD", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sept", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "p002-024", "text": "Sinead's learning to crochet, mostly amigurumi animals. she keeps dropping hints about a nicer hook set lol. coeliac btw so no cake", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sinead", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "crochet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "amigurumi animals", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dropping hints about a nicer hook set", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "coeliac", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "p002-025", "text": "Mei rang - baby took his first steps last night!! 10 months old. she was in bits", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "baby", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first steps", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "10 months old", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in bits", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "p002-027", "text": "Adebayo from work - turns out he's really into board games. regular Gloomhaven campaign w/ his flatmates, owns 200+ games, fave is Twilight Imperium. also a Leicester fan. hates Monopoly w/ a passion lol. his partner Marta paints all his minis. keeps inviting me to a session", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adebayo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from work", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "board games", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Gloomhaven", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "flatmates", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "owns 200+ games", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Twilight Imperium", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i4", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Leicester", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates Monopoly", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marta", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i5", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "paints all his minis", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "p002-031", "text": "Marta's son Juan smashed his A levels - A*AA!! moving to Edinburgh end of Sept to study maths. she's going to miss him loads", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marta", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Juan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "A levels", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Edinburgh", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of Sept", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "study maths", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "going to miss him loads", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
